            "review_title": "Review at Guanabana 21 Thao Đien",
            "review_text": "bnmia\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nFRESH, FRESH AND FRESH\nJul 2018 • Friends\nTo be honest, I love all juices from Guanabana. They used all natural ingredients and especially NO sugar added, it’s such a best choice to stay healthy. \nToday I choose to drink Ginger Tonic, which had Ginger, Apple, Coconut Water and Lime with the benefit is digestion and immune health. First impression about the taste is sooooooo FRESH! the light smell from Ginger makes you can’t stop drinking it. And it’s truly good for my stomach too, love it!\nBeen a customer from 2017 and to be continues.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 3, 2018",
